== Effects ==
* Prevents damage from [[creep]] and floor [[spikes]].

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Sacrifice spikes only damage Isaac for 1/2 hearts. 
** If Isaac has both {{i|Mom's Box|n}} and {{A|Golden Trinket|n}}, all damage is reduced to 1/2 hearts similar to {{I|The Wafer}}.

== Notes ==
* Also grants immunity to slowdown from black and white creep, but not from [[Cobweb]]s.
* Does not prevent any damage from {{R|Curse Room}} doors.
* {{dlc+|a}}Does not prevent damage from {{E|Spiked Chest}}s.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|a}}Does not prevent damage from [[Greed mode]]'s stop button.
* {{dlc|r}} Does not prevent damage from Spiked Rocks.
* {{dlc|nr}} Prevents the use of {{R|Sacrifice Room}}s, unlike [[flight]].
** {{dlc|r}} Can use Sacrifice Rooms now. Can also use the spikes created by {{i|Sanguine Bond}}.

